  "description": "Server side of signing in through Nuv Tools Account, for a product's ASP.NET Core API and web host. Registers the authentication scheme that accepts the Account's access tokens issued for the product — signing keys from the Account's discovery document, exact issuer and audience — names the claims those tokens carry, and serves the Account's address to a browser client. Also the product's client of the Account's API — enrolments, licence types and licences — and the gate: whether a person may use the product now, cached per request. Roles and permissions stay in the product.",
